<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harveys Curnow posts 7 month loss, no div.</title>
<headline>Harveys Curnow posts 7 month loss, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months ended Aug 31 versus six months ended July 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, loss (cts)	 12.2	  vs  1.3 profit</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs   -</p>
<p>    Net loss		  3.86	  vs  0.41 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.78	  vs  0.78</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.08	  vs  0.36</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.28	  vs  0.79</p>
<p>    Turnover		 48.73	  vs 38.47</p>
<p>Full name: Harveys Curnow Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group has changed its year end to August 31.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
